OL,3,AGraduates are managing AI - but are
OL,4,Athey learning much else?
OL,5,
OL,6,FRecent university graduate Lotte
OL,7,FUnderwood is a public relations
OL,8,Fexecutive with a twist - she spends
OL,9,Fmore time using AI than actually doing
OL,10,FPR.
OL,12,FUnderwood, 25, joined London-based PR
OL,13,Fagency Fight or Flight in November last
OL,14,Fyear, in the new role of "AI associate"
OL,15,Fafter completing a degree and then a
OL,16,Fmasters in marketing.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,112,105,200,300,0,100
