OL,3,AGraduates are managing AI - but are
OL,4,Athey learning much else?
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe's part of a recently established,
OL,7,Fdedicated AI team that has built around
OL,8,F30 AI agents. Specific tasks include
OL,9,Findustry research, client reporting,
OL,10,Fmedia interview preparation, helping
OL,11,Fclients create clearer briefs, and
OL,12,Fimage generation.
OL,14,FA big part of Underwood's job is to
OL,15,Fmanage those agents, check their
OL,16,Foutputs and feed those to the team
OL,17,Fmembers who are dealing directly with
OL,18,Fclients and the media.
